{
  "mark.4.p1.b1": {
    "text": "イエスはまたも、海べで教えはじめられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p1.b2": {
    "text": "おびただしい群衆がみもとに集まったので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p1.b3": {
    "text": "イエスは舟に乗ってすわったまま、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p1.b4": {
    "text": "海上におられ、群衆はみな海に沿って陸地にいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p1.b5": {
    "text": "イエスは譬で多くの事を教えられたが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p1.b6": {
    "text": "その教の中で彼らにこう言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p2.b1": {
    "text": "聞きなさい、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p2.b2": {
    "text": "種まきが種をまきに出て行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p2.b3": {
    "text": "まいているうちに、道ばたに落ちた種があった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p2.b4": {
    "text": "すると、鳥がきて食べてしまった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p3.b1": {
    "text": "ほかの種は土の薄い石地に落ちた。そこは土が深くないので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p3.b2": {
    "text": "すぐ芽を出したが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p3.b3": {
    "text": "日が上ると焼けて、根がないために枯れてしまった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p3.b4": {
    "text": "ほかの種はいばらの中に落ちた。すると、いばらが伸びて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p3.b5": {
    "text": "ふさいでしまったので、実を結ばなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p4.b1": {
    "text": "ほかの種は良い地に落ちた。そしてはえて、育って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p4.b2": {
    "text": "ますます実を結び、三十倍、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p4.b3": {
    "text": "六十倍、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p4.b4": {
    "text": "百倍にもなった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p4.b5": {
    "text": "そして言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p4.b6": {
    "text": "聞く耳のある者は聞くがよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b1": {
    "text": "イエスがひとりになられた時、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b2": {
    "text": "そばにいた者たちが、十二弟子と共に、これらの譬について尋ねた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b3": {
    "text": "そこでイエスは言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b4": {
    "text": "あなたがたには神の国の奥義が授けられているが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b5": {
    "text": "ほかの者たちには、すべてが譬で語られる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b6": {
    "text": "彼らは見るには見るが、認めず、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b7": {
    "text": "聞くには聞くが、悟らず、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p5.b8": {
    "text": "悔い改めてゆるされることがないためである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p6.b1": {
    "text": "また彼らに言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p6.b2": {
    "text": "あなたがたはこの譬がわからないのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p6.b3": {
    "text": "それでは、どうしてすべての譬がわかるだろうか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p6.b4": {
    "text": "種まきは御言をまくのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p6.b5": {
    "text": "道ばたに御言がまかれたとは、こういう人たちのことである。すなわち、御言を聞くと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p6.b6": {
    "text": "すぐにサタンがきて、彼らの中にまかれた御言を、奪って行くのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p7.b1": {
    "text": "同じように、石地にまかれたものとは、こういう人たちのことである。御言を聞くと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p7.b2": {
    "text": "すぐに喜んで受けるが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p7.b3": {
    "text": "自分の中に根がないので、しばらく続くだけである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p7.b4": {
    "text": "そののち、御言のために困難や迫害が起ってくると、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p7.b5": {
    "text": "すぐつまずいてしまう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p8.b1": {
    "text": "また、いばらの中にまかれたものとは、こういう人たちのことである。御言を聞くが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p8.b2": {
    "text": "世の心づかいと、富の惑わしと、その他いろいろな欲とがはいってきて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p8.b3": {
    "text": "御言をふさぐので、実を結ばなくなる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p8.b4": {
    "text": "また、良い地にまかれたものとは、こういう人たちのことである。御言を聞いて受けいれ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p8.b5": {
    "text": "三十倍、六十倍、百倍の実を結ぶのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b1": {
    "text": "また彼らに言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b2": {
    "text": "あかりを持ってくることがあろうか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b3": {
    "text": "ますの下や",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b4": {
    "text": "寝台の下に置くために、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b5": {
    "text": "燭台の上に置くためではないか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b6": {
    "text": "なんでも、隠されているもので、現れないものはなく、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b7": {
    "text": "秘密にされているもので、明るみに出ないものはない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p9.b8": {
    "text": "聞く耳のある者は聞くがよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b1": {
    "text": "また彼らに言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b2": {
    "text": "聞くことがらに注意しなさい。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b3": {
    "text": "あなたがたの量るそのはかりで、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b4": {
    "text": "自分にも量り与えられ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b5": {
    "text": "その上になお増し加えられるであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b6": {
    "text": "だれでも、持っている人は更に与えられ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p10.b7": {
    "text": "持っていない人は、持っているものまでも取り上げられるであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b1": {
    "text": "また言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b2": {
    "text": "神の国は、ある人が地に種をまくようなものである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b3": {
    "text": "夜昼、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b4": {
    "text": "寝起きしている間に、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b5": {
    "text": "種は芽を出して育って行くが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b6": {
    "text": "どうしてそうなるのか、その人は知らない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b7": {
    "text": "地はおのずから実を結ばせるもので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b8": {
    "text": "初めに芽、つぎに穂、つぎに穂の中に豊かな実ができる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b9": {
    "text": "実がいると、すぐにかまを入れる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p11.b10": {
    "text": "刈入れ時がきたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b1": {
    "text": "また言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b2": {
    "text": "神の国を何に比べようか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b3": {
    "text": "また、どんな譬で言いあらわそうか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b4": {
    "text": "それは一粒のからし種のようなものである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b5": {
    "text": "地にまかれる時には、地上のどんな種よりも小さいが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b6": {
    "text": "まかれると、成長してどんな野菜よりも大きくなり、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p12.b7": {
    "text": "大きな枝を張り、その陰に空の鳥が宿るほどになる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p13.b1": {
    "text": "イエスはこのような多くの譬で、人々の聞く力にしたがって、御言を語られた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p13.b2": {
    "text": "譬によらないでは語られなかったが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p13.b3": {
    "text": "自分の弟子たちには、ひそかにすべてのことを解き明かされた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p13.b4": {
    "text": "さてその日、夕方になると、イエスは弟子たちに、…と言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p13.b5": {
    "text": "向こう岸へ渡ろう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p14.b1": {
    "text": "そこで、彼らは群衆をあとに残し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p14.b2": {
    "text": "イエスが舟に乗っておられるまま、乗り出した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p14.b3": {
    "text": "ほかの舟も一緒に行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p14.b4": {
    "text": "すると、激しい突風が起り、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p14.b5": {
    "text": "波が舟の中に打ち込んできて、舟に満ちそうになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p15.b1": {
    "text": "ところがイエス自身は、舳の方でまくらをして、眠っておられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p15.b2": {
    "text": "そこで、弟子たちはイエスをおこして、…と言った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p15.b3": {
    "text": "先生、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p15.b4": {
    "text": "わたしどもがおぼれ死んでも、おかまいにならないのですか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p16.b1": {
    "text": "イエスは起きあがって",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p16.b2": {
    "text": "風をしかり、海にむかって、…と言われると、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p16.b3": {
    "text": "静まれ、黙れ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p16.b4": {
    "text": "風はやんで、大なぎになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p17.b1": {
    "text": "イエスは彼らに言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p17.b2": {
    "text": "なぜ、そんなにこわがるのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p17.b3": {
    "text": "どうして信仰がないのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p17.b4": {
    "text": "彼らは恐れおののいて、互に言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p17.b5": {
    "text": "いったい、この方はだれだろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.4.p17.b6": {
    "text": "風も海も従わせるとは",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 4:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
